==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Psyduck}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Psyduck|28}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion.
*'''Headache''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Fossil|Psyduck|53}} from the {{TCG|Fossil}} expansion. It has only ever been featured on {{TCG|Psyduck}} cards.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

